  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dukiya cikin tulunan yumɓu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saboda haka, da yake ta wurin jinƙan Allah ne muke da wannan hidima, ba za mu fid da zuciya ba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba ruwanmu da ɓoye-ɓoye na munafuncin da suke abubuwan kunya. Ba ruwanmu da ruɗu, ko yin ƙarya da kalmar Allah. Sai dai muna faɗin gaskiya a fili. Ta haka ne kowa zai yi shaidar gaskiyarmu a gaban Allah cikin zuciyarsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ko da bishararmu a rufe take, tana a rufe ne ga waɗanda suke hallaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Allahn zamanin nan ya makanta hankulan marasa ba da gaskiya, yadda har ba za su iya ganin hasken bishara ta ɗaukakar Kiristi ba, wanda yake kamannin Allah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gama ba wa'azin kanmu muke yi ba, sai dai na Yesu Kiristi, a kan shi ne Ubangiji, mu kuma bayinku saboda Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Domin shi Allah wanda ya ce, \"Bari haske yă haskaka daga duhu,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ya sa haskensa ya haskaka a cikin zukatanmu, don yă ba mu hasken sanin ɗaukakar Allah a fuskar Kiristi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma muna da wannan dukiya a cikin tulunan yumɓu, don a nuna wannan mafificin ikon nan daga Allah ne, ba daga gare mu ba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A matse muke a kowane gefe, sai dai ba a gurgunta mu ba. An rikitar da mu, amma ba mu fid da zuciya ba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An tsananta mana, amma ba a yashe mu ba, an fyaɗe mu da ƙasa, amma ba a hallaka mu ba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kullum muna ɗauke da mutuwar Yesu a jikinmu, domin ran Yesu yă bayyana a jikinmu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muddin muna a raye, kullum zaman mutuwa muke yi saboda Yesu, don a bayyana ran Yesu ta wurin jikin nan namu mai mutuwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ta haka, mutuwa tana aiki a cikinmu, ku kuwa rai a cikinku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A rubuce yake cewa, \"Na gaskata; saboda haka na yi magana.\" Da wannan ruhun bangaskiya ne mu ma muka gaskata, saboda haka muke magana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Domin mun san cewa shi da ya tā da Ubangiji Yesu daga matattu, zai tashe mu mu ma tare da Kiristi, yă kuma miƙa mu a gabansa tare da ku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duk wannan fa don amfaninku ne, domin alherin nan da yake bazuwa zuwa ga mutane masu yawa, yă zama dalilin godiya mai yawa ga ɗaukakar Allah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saboda haka, ba mu fid da zuciya ba. Ko da yake a waje, jikinmu mai mutuwa yana lalacewa, amma can ciki, ana sabunta mu kowace rana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don wannan 'yar wahalar tamu mai saurin wucewa, ita take tanadar mana madawwamiyar ɗaukaka mai yawa, fiye da kwatanci.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Domin ba abubuwan da ido yake gani ne muke dubawa ba, sai dai marasa ganuwa. Gama abubuwan da ake gani masu saurin wucewa ne, marasa ganuwa kuwa, madawwama ne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
